Housing subscription scoring tables and deposit thresholds are derived from
public Korean statutes (주택공급에 관한 규칙). Notice data, when fetched,
comes from Korea Real Estate Board open data via data.go.kr and remains
subject to that portal's terms. This project is not affiliated with the
government, REB, or Applyhome.
